## How much does a Google Ads or Facebook Ads campaign cost in Morocco?

Wevtex management fees are MAD 200 a day, whichever channels we run: Google, Facebook or Instagram, together or separately. The ad spend, paid directly to Google or Meta, comes on top and stays under your control. In short, Google Ads and Facebook Ads prices in Morocco come down to two lines: our management fee and your budget.

Google Ads has no fixed cost per click: it is set by auction and varies by industry and by competition on each keyword. Before launching, we estimate that cost with Google's planning tool and compare it with the value of a customer, to decide whether the campaign is worth running.

